<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="TVM5.10.11">
<l>nākaṇaimicai nampirāṉ caraṇē caraṇ namak keṉṟu nāṭoṟu</l>
<l>mēka cintaiya ṉāykkuru kūrccaṭa kōpaṉ māṟa</l>
<l>ṉāka nūṟṟa vantāti yāyirattu ḷivaiyumōr pattum vallār</l>
<l>māka vaikuntattu makiḻveytuvar vaikalumē</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
<l>Those who master these one ten among the thousand composed in the breast</l>
<l>of Caṭakōpaṉ Māṟaṉ of Kurukūr, being one with one thought</l>
<l>daily: “refuge our lord on the serpent bed, refuge to us!”,</l>
<l>will daily reach the delights of great Vaikuntam.</l>
      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
